            "prompt": "Settings page for RelaySwitcher. \nLayout: Fixed 220px sidebar on the left. Sidebar contains 'RelaySwitcher' (Playfair Display italic), nav items (仪表盘, 账号, 中转站, 备份, 设置), '设置' active with gold left border. Bottom status pill: '已绑定中转站'.\nMain Content: Single-column scrolling glass cards. Header '设置' with gold 'SETTINGS' sublabel.\nCards (top-to-bottom):\n1. 'Codex 主目录': path input, placeholder '留空 = 默认 ~/.codex', muted text '当前生效: C:\\Users\\ASUS\\.codex'.\n2. 'Provider 标识': single text input.\n3. '模型目录' (Centerpiece): Gold label 'MODEL CATALOG', source pills '内置快照 · 11模型' (selected gold) and '本机提取 · 11模型'. Gold button '从本机 Codex 提取'. Table/Rows for custom models: 'my-custom-6' '我的6' '基于 gpt-6-astra' with edit/delete icons. Input for '部署文件名'.\n4. Amber Warning Card: '清理本机 Provider 区块', description about local server configuration, 'off' toggle.\n5. '切换默认值': '快速模式' toggle 'on', '上下文窗口' value '872000'.\n6. Action Row: Gold '保存设置' button + muted '有未保存的修改'.\n7. '工作原理': Muted text card explaining how switching works.\n8. '关于与更新': Brand mark, 'RelaySwitcher', gold 'v1.5.5' badge, '检查更新' button.\n\nVisuals: Dark 'Neural Noir' theme, dot-grid background, glassmorphism (rgba(255,255,255,0.03) + blur), 16px vertical gaps, gold (#a78b71) used only for labels and active states. All text in Simplified Chinese.",
