      "text": "I've completed the redesign of the RelaySwitcher Settings page, implementing the \"Neural Noir\" instrument-grade aesthetic across the entire layout.\n\n### Design Highlights:\n*   **Fixed Command Sidebar**: Established the 220px persistent navigation with the Playfair Display italic brand mark. The '设置' (Settings) tab is highlighted with a precise gold left border and active typography.\n*   **Refined Glass Hierarchy**: Implemented a single-column scrolling layout using semi-transparent glassmorphic cards (`surface-glass`) layered over the signature radial dot-grid background.\n*   **Modular Control Cards**:\n    *   **Model Catalog**: Designed as the centerpiece with gold-bordered selection pills and a structured list for custom models.\n    *   **Amber Security Context**: Styled the \"Provider Cleanup\" warning with a muted amber tint and high-contrast toggle for clear status indication.\n    *   **Technical Precision**: Applied consistent 0.15em letter-spacing to gold sub-labels and used JetBrains Mono for system paths and version badges to maintain the developer-first feel.\n*   **Instrument Tone**: All interaction points (toggles, buttons, and inputs) use the restrained gold (#a78b71) and slate palette to avoid visual noise while ensuring accessibility.\n\nHow does this structural layout and visual weight feel for your daily workflow?"
